om/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_876512048553713_133527929692827975_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2QcKo7zRxKgQ7kNvwEWtN6T&_nc_oc=AdoW3r9oIaQ8N6UbDnSOHzMU6Nh5rxmDmzSkOX4PHOEShiv6XOgIe4Slq5wHpcQKZSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFHw3BP9o3rufmPTi38kAYbbZX_-Qj4Fj_SHr7LHlrHHQ&oe=6A86D2D8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Surgical Technology", "keywords": ["Surgical", "tech", "immerselearn", "VR", "training"], "long_description": "Short Description (\u2264500 characters):\nSurgical Technology is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it provides hands-on practice in surgical procedures, instrument handling, sterile techniques, and operating room protocols within a realistic virtual environment.\n\nLong Description (\u22641000 characters):\nSurgical Technology is part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This immersive VR simulation delivers realistic, hands-on training in essential surgical technology skills and operating room procedures. Learners can practice sterile techniques, surgical instrument identification and handling, operating room preparation, and workflow coordination in a safe, interactive environment. Designed to align with industry and educational standards, the app helps students strengthen technical accuracy, safety compliance, and confidence before entering real-world clinical settings. Surgical Technology provides a risk-free space for developing critical perioperative skills and improving procedural knowledge through experiential learning. \n\nAccess to this application is restricted to students enrolled in the certification program for their hands-on training.", "short_description": "Surgical Technology is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Surgical 